        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"Powerhound_2000\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/48/1859_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Powerhound_2000:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I imagine Lifeline will have equipment with the relic keyword much like his villain deck does. &nbsp; I'm curious how Lifeline and The Harpy will work their magic compared to Nightmist. &nbsp;Benchmark feels like he will be equipment heavy. &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Also between Lifeline and The Scholar, both have powers related to the Ley Lines, correct?</p>",
