        "created_at": "2016-03-03T19:50:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I understand that all the new heroes will get new icons, but in a way I was hoping they'd match up with a villain in the normal play style. But it's probably unlikely that they'd overlap wth another character isn't it? Unless they have personal grudges against certain heroes? This would only really effect anything if a villain had a hero damage another hero, or effecting all targets.&nbsp;</p>",
